==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{root|ru|ine-pro|*(s)ker-|id=cut}}
From {{der|ru|fr|raccourci|t=shortcut; foreshortening}}. Omitting several steps, from {{m+|la|re-}} + {{m|la|ad-}} + {{der|ru|la|curtus}}.

Comare typologically {{m|ru|вкра́тце}}.

Note natively formed {{m+|pl|ujęcie}} (i.e. ''**уятье'').

===Pronunciation===
* {{ru-IPA|ра́курс}}

